                   <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gamma correction for the background (colors or texture), applied after Background brightness. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.0 = no change; &amp;gt;1 brightens midtones; &amp;lt;1 darkens. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Affects only the background, not scene lighting or objects. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Typical range: ~0.8–2.5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
